WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.021 --> 00:00:06.781
Read the Token BSC contract.

2
00:00:15.764 --> 00:00:18.404
Accept the contract to enroll.

3
00:00:23.672 --> 00:00:26.168
Request token activation.

4
00:00:31.188 --> 00:00:34.020
Check approval to view your token code.

5
00:00:39.519 --> 00:00:41.511
Unlink this token.

6
00:00:50.032 --> 00:00:51.904
Token unlinked.

7
00:00:53.677 --> 00:00:56.989
Verify token activation by SMS.

8
00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.106
SMS code filled.

9
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.272
Tap Verify.
